            "review_title": "Review at Tha Om Garden House",
            "review_text": "Melanie W\nStourbridge, United Kingdom151 contributions\n0\nJust lovely, a little bit different and helping to keep some of Vietnamese history alive!\nJul 2024 • Family\nWe visited this beautiful and unique home, where we were retailed with stories of its family history. \n\nThe owner of the house explained that tourist diners help to pay for the upkeep of the house, and we were glad to be able to contribute in a small way to keeping its history alive. \n\nThen we were served dinner, cooked by the lady of the house and her staff, and ate it by candlelight in the garden surrounded by the sound of crickets.\n\nWe were the only family there on that evening and it felt truly private and special.\n\nDefinitely recommend the experience. Something a little different and off the beaten track!\nRead more\nWritten August 26, 2024",
