            "review_text": "Paddy-Relle\nHervey Bay, Australia454 contributions\n0\nA beautiful house and lovely private courtyard dinner\nSep 2018\nWe had dinner here as part of a small group tour and it was a highlight of the tour. The house itself is stunning and the owners pride in his house and family history is lovely to experience. The dinner setting in the private courtyard is simply beautiful and the food superb. A fantastic experience - the house, the meal, the owner and his daughters, the setting and atmosphere.\nWritten August 9, 2019",
