            "review_text": "suntan47\nChelmsford, United Kingdom1274 contributions\n0\nFabulous evening\nApr 2019 • Couples\nWe visited as part of a tour group and were enthralled by the history of the owner and the amazing house. \n\nAll the other reviewers have described the experience perfectly. Dinner was delicious, we enjoyed all that we ate. Thankfully the portion sizes were small.....there were at least 8 of them. \n\nWe didn't pay extra for drinks or water, this was all included for our group. \n\nIf this is something a travel company can book for their guests then do go.....\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten May 7, 2019",
