            "review_title": "Review at Tha Om Garden House",
            "review_text": "Andrew H\nRochdale, United Kingdom2854 contributions\n0\nPrivate dining experience\nApr 2019 • Couples\nAs part of our tour package we were fortunate enough to visit Mr Vinh and his lovely home in Hue, the Om garden house. As others have stated you get the greeting and tour where Mr Vinh explains the history of the house, his family and the devastation of war. \n\nThen you are invited to sit down to a dining experience where the value certainly outweighs any cost. We had 6/7 courses of shrimp, vegetables, fish, beef, chicken, fruit and cake etc. All delicious and eloquently served. As you dine you listen to the frogs and the birds in this little oasis.\n\nThe meal was excellent, the food delicious and the service outstanding. A real taste of Hue. Highly recommended.\nRead more\nWritten April 15, 2019",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-03",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
