            "review_title": "Review at Tha Om Garden House",
            "review_text": "RockThrust\nMunich, Germany75 contributions\n1\nCharming and unique experience\nNov 2017 • Couples\nI think there are several accurate and detailed accounts of the evening experience (they don't appear to have a website - so I've found three Trip Advisor reference the House), so I won't try and compete or repeat.\n\nWe booked through a local Hue tour agency, so no idea if you can book directly. We're also not aware of the cost - since it was part of a package.\n\nWe paid extra for a couple of beers (tins) and a bottle of red (very nice Loire Pinot Noire). The wine was not the cheapest, but it is all they offer and it perfectly complemented a beautifully cooked, presented and served meal. \n\nDon't do what I did and fail to bring enough cash with me (obviously they don't take credit cards). \n\nWorth doing if you want a more meaningful Vietnamese experience. For us, it will probably be the most memorable experience of the trip.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten November 9, 2017",
