            "review_title": "Review at Tha Om Garden House",
            "review_text": "Robin G\nBay Area, California207 contributions\n1\nA must!\nDec 2016 • Couples\nTha Om was the most unexpected delight of our trip. The owner, an architect, greeted us as the rain poured down. He seated us in a room without walls, and yet perfectly dry, looking out toward his water garden. From there he took us to the dining room where the two of us enjoyed a meal, the menu for which he had written on an open fan in beautiful calligraphy. We will never forget the time we spent at Tha Om. Our most authentic moment in Vietnam.\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten January 7, 2017",
